{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "SpellBounders 2",
    "steam_appid": 2005580,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005580/extras/eb10f9991de32c52cf93ce268c76198f.avif?t=1697675851\" /></div><br><br>Dark paths develop within the mists of Diretome Keep. Wits, words and magic are your only salvation in the realm of twisted horrors and specters. Dominate your opponents with merciless intellect and uncover the mystery of the Diretome in SpellBounders 2, a dark fantasy roguelike word-game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005580/extras/170a79338b9102e866d7bc75953ec43b.avif?t=1697675851\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Coat your tiles in a corrosive poison, heal wounds, summon meteors and much more. Choose from a cast of characters and use their unique talents to defeat your opponents.</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005580/extras/8e0839ab5fd1c775b269b5c7e6fda780.avif?t=1697675851\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enter the treacherous depths of Diretome Keep, a malevolent castle that morphs and twists with each play, lurking with unpredictable horrors and unforgiving trials. Face different enemies, choose different rewards, and even fight different bosses</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005580/extras/a440a10a144807fc47e2643b86861e40.avif?t=1697675851\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unleash your full potential as you climb the dark tower and acquire it's mighty artifacts. Unearth a trove of formidable relics and enigmatic trinkets in your journey and arm yourself with their power.</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005580/extras/4249981614c1e4ac55009635f1db8a89.avif?t=1697675851\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Engage in a battle of the minds against your friends or other players in the Arena and earn the rank of Champion! (Coming soon)</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005580/extras/687490518d72449587de2da947b6c30a.avif?t=1697675851\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Take a well deserved break from the horrors of Diretome Keep and solve Professor Bippy\u2019s daily puzzle. Discover new dimensions of challenge and unlock your problem-solving prowess. (Coming soon)</h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005580/extras/e2e224b8a1d3410c0a45c2e75d8bad09.avif?t=1697675851\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005580/extras/eb10f9991de32c52cf93ce268c76198f.avif?t=1697675851\" /></div><br><br>Dark paths develop within the mists of Diretome Keep. Wits, words and magic are your only salvation in the realm of twisted horrors and specters. Dominate your opponents with merciless intellect and uncover the mystery of the Diretome in SpellBounders 2, a dark fantasy roguelike word-game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005580/extras/170a79338b9102e866d7bc75953ec43b.avif?t=1697675851\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Coat your tiles in a corrosive poison, heal wounds, summon meteors and much more. Choose from a cast of characters and use their unique talents to defeat your opponents.</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005580/extras/8e0839ab5fd1c775b269b5c7e6fda780.avif?t=1697675851\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enter the treacherous depths of Diretome Keep, a malevolent castle that morphs and twists with each play, lurking with unpredictable horrors and unforgiving trials. Face different enemies, choose different rewards, and even fight different bosses</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005580/extras/a440a10a144807fc47e2643b86861e40.avif?t=1697675851\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unleash your full potential as you climb the dark tower and acquire it's mighty artifacts. Unearth a trove of formidable relics and enigmatic trinkets in your journey and arm yourself with their power.</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005580/extras/4249981614c1e4ac55009635f1db8a89.avif?t=1697675851\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Engage in a battle of the minds against your friends or other players in the Arena and earn the rank of Champion! (Coming soon)</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005580/extras/687490518d72449587de2da947b6c30a.avif?t=1697675851\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Take a well deserved break from the horrors of Diretome Keep and solve Professor Bippy\u2019s daily puzzle. Discover new dimensions of challenge and unlock your problem-solving prowess. (Coming soon)</h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005580/extras/e2e224b8a1d3410c0a45c2e75d8bad09.avif?t=1697675851\" /></div>",
